br([["1640 Heryford receights [f.] 9 March 30 Receved at Bradward the whole yeare past, for all rents and corne and other comodities ells, in the yeare 1640: 371i 15s 10d Som totalle receved at Bradward and from every place ellse, for all dues what soever, the whole yeare abowte, ending on St Mary Eve, 1640: 442li 15s 2d", [55, 342, 1527, 286], [54, 380, 180, 346], [55, 450, 1240, 401], [357, 497, 1126, 458], [357, 557, 1667, 513], [359, 662, 1164, 624], [357, 723, 1135, 680], [358, 781, 1666, 735]], ["1641 New receights of rents, anueties & usse moneys, Aprill begining at St Mary Day, 1641, for the whole yeare; 1 written at John Fletchers howse in Widmarsh Streete.", [56, 891, 1241, 840], [54, 946, 1318, 895], [59, 992, 1350, 955]], ["ll Imprimis\u2014rece of Mr Arnold Burghill for a rick hay sould of hay growing at the Cobnalls at harvest, 1640: Sli 7 Rece of Mr Henry Mellin for a load of Ailstree hay: 32s Rece of my cosin John Walsh the half yeares rent of my cosin Edmund Ansleys 2 pastures, due", [51, 1111, 1283, 1060], [54, 1164, 1488, 1120], [55, 1220, 1503, 1175], [358, 1275, 1205, 1231], [358, 1330, 1298, 1286]], ["March the first, 1640, in Oxford shere at Bruckend: 8hi 14 Rece of Mr Francis Trannter of Much Mansell, 6 m>o<nthes usse for 50li, due Aprill the third, 1641: 40s Rece of my cosin Wallop Brabazon of Eaton, 14 6 monthes usse for 150li, due Aprill 18, 1641: 6li Rece from Mrs Dansey of Brinsop, 6 months", [358, 1381, 1487, 1341], [59, 1437, 1264, 1396], [358, 1494, 1503, 1451], [358, 1548, 1220, 1506], [59, 1604, 1487, 1561], [358, 1659, 1214, 1616]], ["May usse for 40li lent to her sonne, John Dansey, due Aprill 10, 1640[?]: 32s 1 Rece of John Giles, 6 months use for 4li, due February 24, 1640: 3s 2d hay Rece of Mr Atrnotd Burghit of Withington, for sould atick of oud hay at the Cobbnatts: Sh t ; t ee Si Os Ot", [55, 1717, 1269, 1667], [357, 1768, 1502, 1725], [59, 1820, 1205, 1781], [358, 1877, 1537, 1835], [54, 1936, 1261, 1886], [54, 1995, 1488, 1941], [654, 2047, 1597, 1995]], ["hay Rece of Mr John Hearing of Hollmer, for a loade of hay out of my stable in Heriford: 26s 8d Sould a rick of hay out of Cobnalls to John Birt for: 5li 6s 8d Rece of Mr Alixander Munne & Mr Thomas Munne of Dillwin, 6 monthes usse for 30li, due January 2, 1640: 24s", [53, 2097, 1148, 2055], [357, 2152, 1559, 2110], [358, 2207, 1594, 2165], [357, 2254, 1398, 2219], [356, 2316, 1501, 2275]], ["2; Rece of Walter Wallton of Munktand Newton, 6 months usse for 5li, due February 25, 1640: 4s Rece of Mr Isack Weaver, 6 months usse for 50li, due November 3, 1640, by M Rufford: 40s *6 This entry and the one preceding it have two vertical lines drawn through them and the amounts", [53, 2375, 1393, 2327], [356, 2426, 1479, 2385], [356, 2479, 1191, 2439], [357, 2536, 1501, 2494], [51, 2847, 1673, 2807]], ["have been struck out. The entry re John Birt reappears two lines later.", [51, 2896, 1222, 2857]]]);
